<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>{{ config.brand.name }} AEO Snapshot | Free Preview</title>
<style>
  :root {
    --ink: #0f172a;
    --ink-2: #1e293b;
    --muted: #64748b;
    --muted-2: #94a3b8;
    --line: rgba(148, 163, 184, .24);
    --panel: rgba(255, 255, 255, .88);
    --panel-solid: #ffffff;
    --bg: #f8fafc;
    --accent: #2563eb;
    --accent-2: #7c3aed;
    --accent-3: #06b6d4;
    --danger: #dc2626;
    --danger-bg: #fef2f2;
    --warning: #d97706;
    --warning-bg: #fffbeb;
    --success: #16a34a;
    --success-bg: #f0fdf4;
    --shadow: 0 22px 60px rgba(15, 23, 42, .10);
    --shadow-soft: 0 14px 35px rgba(15, 23, 42, .08);
    --radius: 24px;
    --radius-sm: 16px;
  }

  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
  body {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--ink);
    font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
    line-height: 1.55;
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 8% 0%, rgba(37, 99, 235, .16), transparent 32rem),
      radial-gradient(circle at 85% 8%, rgba(124, 58, 237, .12), transparent 30rem),
      linear-gradient(180deg, #f8fbff 0%, #f8fafc 38%, #eef4ff 100%);
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    padding: 0;
  }

  a { color: inherit; }

  .page-shell {
    width: min(1180px, calc(100% - 40px));
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 28px 0 56px;
  }

  .topbar {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 18px;
    margin-bottom: 26px;
  }

  .brand-mark {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -.03em;
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .brand-mark .logo {
    width: 42px;
    height: 42px;
    border-radius: 14px;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    color: white;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent), var(--accent-2));
    box-shadow: 0 14px 30px rgba(37, 99, 235, .26);
  }

  .top-actions {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 13px;
  }

  .chip {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 7px;
    padding: 7px 11px;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .74);
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: .02em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
  }

  .chip.warning { color: #92400e; background: rgba(255, 251, 235, .9); border-color: rgba(217, 119, 6, .22); }
  .chip.blue { color: #1d4ed8; background: rgba(239, 246, 255, .9); border-color: rgba(37, 99, 235, .22); }
  .chip.dark { color: #334155; background: rgba(241, 245, 249, .9); }

  .hero {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: 34px;
    padding: 34px;
    background:
      linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(15, 23, 42, .97) 0%, rgba(30, 41, 59, .96) 48%, rgba(30, 64, 175, .94) 100%);
    color: white;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
  }

  .hero::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    inset: -2px;
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 78% 20%, rgba(6, 182, 212, .28), transparent 24rem),
      radial-gradient(circle at 8% 90%, rgba(124, 58, 237, .32), transparent 22rem);
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .hero-grid {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.15fr .85fr;
    gap: 34px;
    align-items: stretch;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 8px 12px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .10);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, .15);
    color: rgba(255,255,255,.82);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: .08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  h1 {
    margin: 20px 0 12px;
    font-size: clamp(42px, 6vw, 72px);
    line-height: .94;
    letter-spacing: -.07em;
    max-width: 820px;
  }

  .hero-lede {
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 730px;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, .78);
    font-size: 18px;
  }

  .hero-lede strong { color: white; }

  .hero-meta {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 10px;
    margin-top: 26px;
  }

  code {
    font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, "Liberation Mono", monospace;
    font-size: .92em;
    padding: 2px 6px;
    background: rgba(15, 23, 42, .06);
    border-radius: 8px;
    color: #1e293b;
  }

  .hero code { background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .12); color: white; }

  .audit-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    min-height: 100%;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, .14);
    border-radius: 26px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .09);
    backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: 0 20px 55px rgba(0,0,0,.16);
  }

  .browser-bar {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 14px 16px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.13);
    background: rgba(15, 23, 42, .2);
  }

  .dot { width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 999px; background: rgba(255,255,255,.36); }
  .address {
    margin-left: 6px;
    flex: 1;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);
    background: rgba(255,255,255,.08);
    border-radius: 999px;
    padding: 6px 10px;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,.7);
    font-size: 12px;
    white-space: nowrap;
    overflow: hidden;
    text-overflow: ellipsis;
  }

  .screenshot-frame {
    position: relative;
    height: 230px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,255,255,.16), rgba(255,255,255,.04));
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.13);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .screenshot-frame img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: top center;
    transform: scale(1.01);
  }

  .screenshot-frame::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(2,6,23,0) 45%, rgba(2,6,23,.46) 100%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .screenshot-caption {
    position: absolute;
    left: 16px;
    right: 16px;
    bottom: 14px;
    z-index: 1;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 12px;
    color: white;
    font-size: 12px;
  }

  .screenshot-caption span {
    padding: 6px 10px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.22);
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: rgba(15, 23, 42, .42);
    backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
  }

  .screenshot-caption a {
    color: white;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 700;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }


  .audit-body { padding: 20px; }

  .mini-score {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-top: 18px;
  }

  .mini-score div {
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.13);
    border-radius: 18px;
    padding: 15px;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,.08);
  }

  .mini-score span { display: block; color: rgba(255,255,255,.62); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .05em; }
  .mini-score strong { display: block; margin-top: 4px; font-size: 32px; letter-spacing: -.04em; }

  .hero-footnote { margin: 18px 0 0; color: rgba(255,255,255,.62); font-size: 13px; }

  .cta-row { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; margin-top: 28px; }

  .btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 10px;
    min-height: 46px;
    padding: 13px 18px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 14px;
    transition: transform .18s ease, box-shadow .18s ease, background .18s ease;
  }

  .btn:hover { transform: translateY(-1px); }
  .btn.primary { background: white; color: #1d4ed8; box-shadow: 0 18px 35px rgba(0,0,0,.22); }
  .btn.secondary { background: rgba(255,255,255,.10); color: white; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18); }
  .btn.blue { background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent), var(--accent-2)); color: white; box-shadow: 0 18px 32px rgba(37, 99, 235, .24); }

  .section {
    margin-top: 28px;
    padding: 30px;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    background: var(--panel);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, .8);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);
    backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
  }

  .section-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: end;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 18px;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }

  h2 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(24px, 3vw, 34px);
    letter-spacing: -.045em;
    line-height: 1.05;
  }

  .section-subtitle {
    margin: 8px 0 0;
    max-width: 690px;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 14px;
  }

  .takeaway {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: auto 1fr;
    gap: 20px;
    align-items: start;
    padding: 26px;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    background:
      linear-gradient(135deg, #fff7ed 0%, #fff 52%, #eff6ff 100%);
    border: 1px solid rgba(251, 146, 60, .28);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);
  }

  .takeaway::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    width: 240px;
    height: 240px;
    right: -100px;
    top: -120px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(245, 158, 11, .24), transparent 70%);
  }

  .signal-icon {
    width: 58px;
    height: 58px;
    border-radius: 20px;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    color: white;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f97316, #dc2626);
    box-shadow: 0 16px 32px rgba(220, 38, 38, .20);
  }

  .takeaway .label {
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    color: var(--warning);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 900;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: .10em;
  }

  .takeaway h3 {
    margin: 0 0 10px;
    font-size: clamp(25px, 3.2vw, 40px);
    line-height: 1.05;
    letter-spacing: -.05em;
  }

  .takeaway p { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); max-width: 820px; }
  .takeaway p + p { margin-top: 10px; }
  .takeaway strong { color: var(--ink); }
  .takeaway .stat-line strong { color: var(--danger); }

  .takeaway-competitor-note {
    margin: 12px 0 14px;
    max-width: 780px;
    font-size: clamp(18px, 2vw, 24px);
    line-height: 1.35;
    color: #475569;
    font-style: italic;
    letter-spacing: -.02em;
  }

  .takeaway-competitor-note strong {
    color: var(--ink);
    font-style: normal;
  }

  .cards {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .card {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    min-height: 160px;
    padding: 20px;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 22px;
    background: var(--panel-solid);
    box-shadow: 0 12px 28px rgba(15, 23, 42, .055);
  }

  .card::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    inset: auto -32px -42px auto;
    width: 140px;
    height: 140px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: rgba(37, 99, 235, .09);
  }

  .card.headline-bad::after { background: rgba(220, 38, 38, .10); }
  .card .label {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 900;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: .09em;
  }
  .card .value {
    margin-top: 12px;
    font-size: 46px;
    line-height: .95;
    font-weight: 900;
    letter-spacing: -.06em;
  }
  .card.headline-bad .value { color: var(--danger); }
  .card.headline-good .value { color: var(--success); }
  .card .caption { margin-top: 10px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; }

  .insight-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: .82fr 1.18fr;
    gap: 18px;
  }

  .empty {
    color: var(--muted);
    padding: 22px;
    border: 1px dashed rgba(100, 116, 139, .32);
    border-radius: 18px;
    background: rgba(248, 250, 252, .74);
    font-size: 14px;
  }

  .bar-list {
    display: grid;
    gap: 11px;
  }

  .bar-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(120px, 210px) 1fr 44px;
    gap: 12px;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 12px 14px;
    border-radius: 16px;
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .bar-row .name {
    color: var(--ink-2);
    font-weight: 750;
    font-size: 14px;
    overflow: hidden;
    text-overflow: ellipsis;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .bar-row .bar {
    height: 10px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: #e2e8f0;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .bar-row .bar > div {
    height: 100%;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--accent), var(--accent-3));
  }
  .bar-row .num {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-weight: 800;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    text-align: right;
  }

  details {
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 20px;
    background: white;
    box-shadow: 0 12px 28px rgba(15, 23, 42, .055);
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  details summary {
    cursor: pointer;
    list-style: none;
    padding: 18px 20px;
    font-weight: 850;
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  details summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
  details[open] summary { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }

  .pill {
    display: inline-flex;
    vertical-align: middle;
    align-items: center;
    margin-left: 6px;
    padding: 4px 9px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: #f1f5f9;
    color: #475569;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 850;
    letter-spacing: .02em;
  }
  .pill.bad { background: var(--danger-bg); color: var(--danger); }
  .pill.good { background: var(--success-bg); color: var(--success); }
  .pill.warn { background: var(--warning-bg); color: var(--warning); }

  .response-text {
    min-height: 120px;
    margin: 18px 20px 20px;
    padding: 18px;
    color: var(--muted);
    background: #f8fafc;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 16px;
    font-size: 13px;
    white-space: pre-wrap;
  }
  .response-text:empty::before {
    content: "No visible answer text was captured in this free preview sample.";
    color: var(--muted-2);
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .locked {
    position: relative;
    min-height: 390px;
    overflow: hidden;
    margin-top: 16px;
    border-radius: 24px;
    background: white;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    box-shadow: 0 14px 32px rgba(15, 23, 42, .065);
  }

  .locked .blur {
    filter: blur(5px);
    opacity: .52;
    user-select: none;
    pointer-events: none;
    padding: 28px;
    min-height: 390px;
  }

  .locked .overlay {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 32px 24px;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,.58) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,.95) 70%);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .overlay-card {
    width: min(620px, 100%);
    max-width: 620px;
    padding: 30px 28px;
    border-radius: 24px;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,.86);
    border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, .26);
    box-shadow: 0 18px 46px rgba(15,23,42,.13);
    backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
  }

  .lock-icon {
    width: 46px;
    height: 46px;
    margin: 0 auto 12px;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    border-radius: 16px;
    color: #1d4ed8;
    background: #eff6ff;
  }
  .overlay h4 { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 22px; letter-spacing: -.035em; }
  .overlay p { margin: 0 auto 16px; color: var(--muted); max-width: 540px; font-size: 14px; }

  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: separate; border-spacing: 0; overflow: hidden; border-radius: 16px; }
  td, th { padding: 11px; font-size: 13px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, .18); }
  th { color: #334155; background: #f8fafc; text-align: left; }

  .cta-block {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    margin-top: 30px;
    padding: 38px;
    border-radius: 30px;
    color: white;
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 86% 0%, rgba(6, 182, 212, .34), transparent 22rem),
      linear-gradient(135deg, #1d4ed8 0%, #4338ca 50%, #6d28d9 100%);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    text-align: center;
  }
  .cta-block h2 { color: white; font-size: clamp(31px, 4vw, 50px); }
  .cta-block p { margin: 12px auto 0; max-width: 670px; color: rgba(255,255,255,.78); }
  .cta-block .specs {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0,1fr));
    gap: 14px;
    margin: 28px 0;
    text-align: left;
  }
  .cta-block .specs div {
    padding: 18px;
    border-radius: 20px;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,.10);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.14);
  }
  .cta-block .specs strong { display: block; font-size: 34px; line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -.05em; }
  .cta-block .specs span { display: block; margin-top: 6px; color: rgba(255,255,255,.75); font-size: 12px; }

  .footer-note {
    margin: 26px 0 0;
    text-align: center;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 12px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 930px) {
    .hero-grid, .insight-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .cards, .cta-block .specs { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
    .hero { padding: 26px; }
    .section { padding: 22px; }
  }

  @media (max-width: 620px) {
    .page-shell { width: min(100% - 24px, 1180px); padding-top: 16px; }
    .topbar, .section-header { align-items: flex-start; flex-direction: column; }
    .cards, .cta-block .specs, .mini-score { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .bar-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 8px; }
    .bar-row .num { text-align: left; }
    .takeaway { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    h1 { font-size: 44px; }
  }

  @media print {
    body { background: white; }
    .page-shell { width: 100%; padding: 0; }
    .section, .hero, .cta-block { box-shadow: none; break-inside: avoid; }
    .btn { border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; }
  }

  /* Multi-engine selector */
  .engine-panel {
    margin-top: 28px;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    background: rgba(255,255,255,.78);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .engine-panel-head {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
    gap: 18px;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 24px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(239,246,255,.92), rgba(255,255,255,.86));
  }

  .engine-panel-head h3 {
    margin: 0 0 6px;
    font-size: 22px;
    line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: -.035em;
  }

  .engine-panel-head p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 14px;
    max-width: 760px;
  }

  .engine-tabs {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 10px;
    padding: 18px 24px 0;
  }

  .engine-tab {
    appearance: none;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: #fff;
    color: var(--muted);
    cursor: pointer;
    font: inherit;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 800;
    padding: 10px 14px;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    transition: transform .18s ease, border-color .18s ease, color .18s ease, box-shadow .18s ease;
  }

  .engine-tab:hover { transform: translateY(-1px); border-color: rgba(37,99,235,.32); color: var(--accent); }
  .engine-tab.active {
    color: #fff;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent), var(--accent-2));
    border-color: transparent;
    box-shadow: 0 14px 28px rgba(37, 99, 235, .22);
  }

  .engine-tab.locked-tab {
    padding-right: 10px;
  }

  .tab-lock {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    border-radius: 999px;
    padding: 3px 7px;
    background: #eef2ff;
    color: #4f46e5;
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 900;
    letter-spacing: .04em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .engine-tab.active .tab-lock {
    background: rgba(255,255,255,.2);
    color: #fff;
  }

  .engine-dot {
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: currentColor;
    opacity: .7;
  }

  .engine-content {
    padding: 24px;
  }

  .engine-view { display: none; }
  .engine-view.active { display: block; }

  .engine-detail-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, .95fr) minmax(0, 1.05fr);
    gap: 18px;
    align-items: stretch;
  }

  .engine-score-card, .engine-copy-card {
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 22px;
    background: #fff;
    padding: 22px;
  }

  .engine-score-card h4, .engine-copy-card h4 {
    margin: 0 0 12px;
    font-size: 16px;
    letter-spacing: -.02em;
  }

  .engine-stats {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .engine-stat {
    border-radius: 16px;
    background: #f8fafc;
    border: 1px solid rgba(148,163,184,.18);
    padding: 14px;
  }

  .engine-stat span {
    display: block;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: .06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .engine-stat strong {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 4px;
    font-size: 28px;
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: -.045em;
  }

  .engine-copy-card p {
    margin: 0 0 12px;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 14px;
  }

  .engine-query-list {
    margin: 14px 0 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .engine-query-list div {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 12px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(148,163,184,.18);
    border-radius: 14px;
    background: #f8fafc;
    padding: 10px 12px;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--ink-2);
  }

  .locked-engine {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .locked-engine::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255,255,255,0), rgba(255,255,255,.72), rgba(255,255,255,0));
    transform: translateX(-100%);
    animation: sheen 3.2s infinite;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  @keyframes sheen {
    0% { transform: translateX(-100%); }
    42%, 100% { transform: translateX(100%); }
  }

  .engine-locked-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 18px;
    align-items: stretch;
  }

  .engine-placeholder {
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 22px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fff, #f8fafc);
    padding: 22px;
  }

  .placeholder-bars {
    display: grid;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-top: 18px;
  }

  .placeholder-bars span {
    display: block;
    height: 14px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, #e2e8f0, #f1f5f9);
  }

  .placeholder-bars span:nth-child(2) { width: 82%; }
  .placeholder-bars span:nth-child(3) { width: 64%; }
  .placeholder-bars span:nth-child(4) { width: 74%; }

  .engine-lock-card {
    border: 1px solid rgba(37,99,235,.18);
    border-radius: 22px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(239,246,255,.92), rgba(255,255,255,.94));
    padding: 24px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .engine-lock-card h4 { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 20px; letter-spacing: -.035em; }
  .engine-lock-card p { margin: 0 0 16px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 14px; }
  .engine-lock-card ul { margin: 0; padding-left: 18px; color: var(--ink-2); font-size: 14px; }
  .engine-lock-card li + li { margin-top: 6px; }

  @media (max-width: 820px) {
    .engine-panel-head, .engine-detail-grid, .engine-locked-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .engine-tabs { padding-top: 14px; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
{% set visible = (agg.visible_pct | float) %}
{% set total_queries = agg.total %}
{% set visible_count = ((visible / 100) * total_queries) | round | int %}
{% set engines_total = 5 %}
{% set competitors_in_text = (agg.competitor_text_counts | map(attribute=0) | list) if agg.competitor_text_counts else [] %}
{% set competitors_in_citations = (agg.competitor_citation_counts | map(attribute=0) | list) if agg.competitor_citation_counts else [] %}
{% set competitors_seen = (competitors_in_text + competitors_in_citations) | unique | list %}
{% set first_query = agg.by_query.keys() | list | first %}
{% set first_rows = agg.by_query[first_query] if first_query else [] %}
{% set competitor_names %}{% for c in competitors_seen %}{{ c }}{% if not loop.last %}{% if loop.revindex0 == 1 %} and {% else %}, {% endif %}{% endif %}{% endfor %}{% endset %}
{% set competitor_names_strong %}{% for c in competitors_seen %}<strong>{{ c }}</strong>{% if not loop.last %}{% if loop.revindex0 == 1 %} and {% else %}, {% endif %}{% endif %}{% endfor %}{% endset %}
  <main class="page-shell">
    <header class="topbar">
      <div class="brand-mark">
        <div class="logo" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" role="img" aria-label="AEO icon"><path d="M4 17.5L9.5 12l3.5 3.5L20 8.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M16 8h4v4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        </div>
        <span>AEO Snapshot</span>
      </div>
      <div class="top-actions">
        <span class="chip warning">Free preview</span>
        <span class="chip dark">{{ config.brand.name }}</span>
      </div>
    </header>

    <section class="hero">
      <div class="hero-grid">
        <div>
          <span class="eyebrow">AI answer visibility audit</span>
          <h1>
            {% if visible == 0 %}
              {{ config.brand.name }} is invisible in Google AI Overviews.
            {% elif visible < 50 %}
              {{ config.brand.name }} is barely showing up in Google AI Overviews.
            {% else %}
              {{ config.brand.name }} appears in Google AI Overviews — but who else is being cited?
            {% endif %}
          </h1>
          <p class="hero-lede">
            {% if visible == 0 %}
              <strong>Google's AI did not mention {{ config.brand.name }} once</strong> across {{ total_queries }} commercial questions in this category. This preview shows the visibility gap and where Google is sourcing answers instead.
            {% else %}
              Google's AI named <strong>{{ config.brand.name }} in {{ visible_count }} of {{ total_queries }} answers</strong> in this preview. The full report shows whether 4 other engines do the same.
            {% endif %}
          </p>
          <div class="hero-meta">
            <span class="chip blue">Domain <code>{{ config.brand.domain }}</code></span>
            <span class="chip blue">Engine: Google AI Overviews</span>
            <span class="chip blue">{{ total_queries }} queries tested</span>
          </div>
          <div class="cta-row">
            <a href="#visibility" class="btn primary">View snapshot</a>
            <a href="#upgrade" class="btn secondary">Unlock full audit</a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <aside class="audit-card" aria-label="Audit summary card">
          <div class="browser-bar">
            <span class="dot"></span><span class="dot"></span><span class="dot"></span>
            <div class="address">https://{{ config.brand.domain }}</div>
          </div>
          <div class="screenshot-frame">
            {% if screenshot %}
              <img src="{{ screenshot }}" alt="Screenshot of {{ config.brand.domain }}">
            {% else %}
              <img src="https://s.wordpress.com/mshots/v1/https%3A%2F%2F{{ config.brand.domain }}?w=1200" alt="Screenshot of {{ config.brand.domain }}">
            {% endif %}
            <div class="screenshot-caption">
              <span>Website audited</span>
              <a href="https://{{ config.brand.domain }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{ config.brand.domain }} ↗</a>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="audit-body">
            <span class="chip warning">Audit subject</span>
            <h3 style="margin:16px 0 6px;font-size:28px;letter-spacing:-.045em;line-height:1.05;color:white;">{{ config.brand.name }} visibility check</h3>
            <p style="margin:0;color:rgba(255,255,255,.68);font-size:14px;">Snapshot of how AI answer engines surface, cite, and compare {{ config.brand.name }} in buyer-facing queries.</p>
            <div class="mini-score">
              <div><span>Visibility</span><strong style="color:white;">{{ agg.visible_pct }}%</strong></div>
              <div><span>Citation rate</span><strong style="color:white;">{{ agg.cited_pct }}%</strong></div>
            </div>
            <p class="hero-footnote">Full report expands this to 5 engines, 40 queries and 200 individual AI answers.</p>
          </div>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" id="visibility">
      <div class="takeaway">
        <div class="signal-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 9v4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M12 17h.01" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M10.29 3.86L1.82 18a2 2 0 001.71 3h16.94a2 2 0 001.71-3L13.71 3.86a2 2 0 00-3.42 0z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="label">The takeaway</div>
          <h3>
            {% if visible == 0 %}
              {{ total_queries }} potential customers asked Google a question {{ config.brand.name }} should answer — and got an answer that did not include {{ config.brand.name }}.
            {% elif visible < 50 %}
              {{ config.brand.name }} only appears in {{ visible_count }} of {{ total_queries }} Google AI answers — there's a clear visibility gap.
            {% else %}
              {{ config.brand.name }} shows up in most Google AI answers — but the bigger question is what Claude, ChatGPT, Perplexity and Gemini are doing.
            {% endif %}
          </h3>
          {% if competitors_seen %}
          <p class="takeaway-competitor-note"><em>Google pointed them to {{ competitor_names_strong | safe }} instead.</em></p>
          {% endif %}
          <p class="stat-line">
            <strong>{{ agg.visible_pct }}% visibility</strong>
            {% if visible == 0 %}
              means {{ config.brand.name }} was not named in any answer in this sample{% if agg.cited_pct and agg.cited_pct > 0 %}, even though one answer linked to the site{% endif %}.
            {% else %}
              means {{ visible_count }} of {{ total_queries }} answers named {{ config.brand.name }} directly.
            {% endif %}
          </p>
          <p>The full report tests <strong>4 more AI engines</strong> across <strong>32 more queries</strong>, including head-to-head comparisons, hallucination detection and a complete competitor breakdown.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="section-header" style="margin-top:28px;">
        <div>
          <h2>Your visibility on Google AI Overviews</h2>
          <p class="section-subtitle">A concise view of whether Google AI Overviews names {{ config.brand.name }}, links to {{ config.brand.name }}, or cites competing sources when answering buyer questions.</p>
        </div>
        <span class="chip dark">Free tier results</span>
      </div>
      <div class="cards">
        <div class="card {% if visible < 30 %}headline-bad{% elif visible >= 60 %}headline-good{% endif %}">
          <div class="label">Visibility</div>
          <div class="value">{{ agg.visible_pct }}%</div>
          <div class="caption">of answers named {{ config.brand.name }}</div>
        </div>
        <div class="card {% if agg.cited_pct < 20 %}headline-bad{% elif agg.cited_pct >= 50 %}headline-good{% endif %}">
          <div class="label">Citation rate</div>
          <div class="value">{{ agg.cited_pct }}%</div>
          <div class="caption">of answers linked to {{ config.brand.name }}</div>
        </div>
        <div class="card {% if agg.avg_competitors_cited > 1 %}headline-bad{% endif %}">
          <div class="label">Competitors cited</div>
          <div class="value">{{ agg.avg_competitors_cited }}</div>
          <div class="caption">average per question</div>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <div class="label">Questions tested</div>
          <div class="value">{{ total_queries }}</div>
          <div class="caption">free preview sample</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="engine-panel" id="llm-coverage">
        <div class="engine-panel-head">
          <div>
            <h3>Choose an AI engine to inspect visibility</h3>
            <p>This preview includes live Google AI Overview results only. The full audit uses the same visibility framework across the main answer engines buyers now use to research {{ config.brand.name }} and its category.</p>
          </div>
          <span class="chip blue">5-engine coverage</span>
        </div>
        <div class="engine-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="AI engine visibility selector">
          <button class="engine-tab active" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="true" data-engine-tab="google"><span class="engine-dot"></span>Google AI Overviews</button>
          <button class="engine-tab locked-tab" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-engine-tab="chatgpt"><span class="engine-dot"></span>ChatGPT <span class="tab-lock">Unlock</span></button>
          <button class="engine-tab locked-tab" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-engine-tab="claude"><span class="engine-dot"></span>Claude <span class="tab-lock">Unlock</span></button>
          <button class="engine-tab locked-tab" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-engine-tab="perplexity"><span class="engine-dot"></span>Perplexity <span class="tab-lock">Unlock</span></button>
          <button class="engine-tab locked-tab" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-engine-tab="gemini"><span class="engine-dot"></span>Gemini <span class="tab-lock">Unlock</span></button>
        </div>
        <div class="engine-content">
          <div class="engine-view active" data-engine-view="google" role="tabpanel">
            <div class="engine-detail-grid">
              <div class="engine-score-card">
                <span class="chip warning">Available in this preview</span>
                <h4 style="margin-top:16px;">Google AI Overview visibility</h4>
                <div class="engine-stats">
                  <div class="engine-stat"><span>Visibility</span><strong>{{ agg.visible_pct }}%</strong></div>
                  <div class="engine-stat"><span>Citation rate</span><strong>{{ agg.cited_pct }}%</strong></div>
                  <div class="engine-stat"><span>Questions tested</span><strong>{{ total_queries }}</strong></div>
                  <div class="engine-stat"><span>Competitors cited</span><strong>{{ agg.avg_competitors_cited }}</strong></div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="engine-copy-card">
                <h4>What this means</h4>
                <p>
                {% if visible == 0 %}
                  In this free sample, Google AI Overviews did not name {{ config.brand.name }} in any tested answer{% if agg.cited_pct and agg.cited_pct > 0 %}. One answer linked to {{ config.brand.name }}, but the brand was not surfaced directly in the response text{% endif %}.
                {% else %}
                  In this free sample, Google AI Overviews named {{ config.brand.name }} in {{ visible_count }} of {{ total_queries }} answers.
                {% endif %}
                </p>
                <p>The full report repeats this same check across the other engines so the team can see whether invisibility is a Google-specific issue or an AI-wide discovery gap.</p>
                <div class="engine-query-list" aria-label="Example query coverage">
                  <div><span>Brand questions</span><strong>tested</strong></div>
                  <div><span>Category questions</span><strong>tested</strong></div>
                  <div><span>Problem-led questions</span><strong>tested</strong></div>
                  <div><span>Comparison questions</span><strong>full audit</strong></div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="engine-view" data-engine-view="chatgpt" role="tabpanel">
            <div class="engine-locked-grid locked-engine">
              <div class="engine-placeholder">
                <span class="chip dark">Locked in preview</span>
                <h4>ChatGPT visibility data</h4>
                <div class="placeholder-bars"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
              </div>
              <div class="engine-lock-card">
                <h4>See whether ChatGPT recommends {{ config.brand.name }}</h4>
                <p>The full audit captures how ChatGPT answers brand, category, problem and comparison prompts in {{ config.brand.name }}'s category.</p>
                <ul><li>Brand mentions and share of answer</li><li>Competitors named in the same response</li><li>Sentiment, claims and content gaps</li></ul>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="engine-view" data-engine-view="claude" role="tabpanel">
            <div class="engine-locked-grid locked-engine">
              <div class="engine-placeholder">
                <span class="chip dark">Locked in preview</span>
                <h4>Claude visibility data</h4>
                <div class="placeholder-bars"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
              </div>
              <div class="engine-lock-card">
                <h4>See whether Claude understands the offer</h4>
                <p>The full audit shows whether Claude describes {{ config.brand.name }} accurately, cites the right evidence and positions the brand against competitors.</p>
                <ul><li>Answer inclusion by query type</li><li>Accuracy and hallucination checks</li><li>Recommended evidence to publish</li></ul>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="engine-view" data-engine-view="perplexity" role="tabpanel">
            <div class="engine-locked-grid locked-engine">
              <div class="engine-placeholder">
                <span class="chip dark">Locked in preview</span>
                <h4>Perplexity visibility data</h4>
                <div class="placeholder-bars"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
              </div>
              <div class="engine-lock-card">
                <h4>See which sources Perplexity trusts</h4>
                <p>The full audit identifies which pages, publishers and competitor domains Perplexity cites when answering commercial buyer questions.</p>
                <ul><li>Citation source map</li><li>Competitor co-mentions</li><li>PR and content opportunities</li></ul>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="engine-view" data-engine-view="gemini" role="tabpanel">
            <div class="engine-locked-grid locked-engine">
              <div class="engine-placeholder">
                <span class="chip dark">Locked in preview</span>
                <h4>Gemini visibility data</h4>
                <div class="placeholder-bars"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
              </div>
              <div class="engine-lock-card">
                <h4>See how Gemini frames the category</h4>
                <p>The full audit checks whether Gemini surfaces {{ config.brand.name }} in buyer journeys and where content needs to be strengthened for AI answer inclusion.</p>
                <ul><li>Visibility by query intent</li><li>Missing entities and claims</li><li>Actionable optimisation priorities</li></ul>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <div class="section-header">
        <div>
          <h2>Competitor and source intelligence</h2>
          <p class="section-subtitle">The free preview shows early source patterns. The larger audit usually reveals a clearer map of competitors, citation sources and content opportunities.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="insight-grid">
        <div>
          <h3 style="margin:0 0 12px;font-size:18px;letter-spacing:-.02em;">Competitors Google cited instead of {{ config.brand.name }}</h3>
          {% if agg.competitor_text_counts or agg.competitor_citation_counts %}
            {% set comp_data = agg.competitor_citation_counts if agg.competitor_citation_counts else agg.competitor_text_counts %}
            <div class="bar-list">
              {% set max_cmp = comp_data[0][1] %}
              {% for name, count in comp_data %}
                <div class="bar-row">
                  <div class="name">{{ name }}</div>
                  <div class="bar"><div style="width: {{ (count / max_cmp * 100) | round(0) }}%;"></div></div>
                  <div class="num">{{ count }}×</div>
                </div>
              {% endfor %}
            </div>
          {% else %}
            <div class="empty">No competitors were mentioned in this {{ total_queries }}-query sample. A larger 40-query audit is more likely to expose recurring competitors and comparison gaps.</div>
          {% endif %}
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 style="margin:0 0 12px;font-size:18px;letter-spacing:-.02em;">Where Google's AI gets its answers</h3>
          {% if agg.top_domains %}
            {% set max_count = agg.top_domains[0][1] %}
            <div class="bar-list">
              {% for domain, count in agg.top_domains[:8] %}
                <div class="bar-row">
                  <div class="name">{{ domain }}</div>
                  <div class="bar"><div style="width: {{ (count / max_count * 100) | round(0) }}%;"></div></div>
                  <div class="num">{{ count }}×</div>
                </div>
              {% endfor %}
            </div>
          {% else %}
            <div class="empty">No external citations captured in this sample.</div>
          {% endif %}
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <div class="section-header">
        <div>
          <h2>Sample answer evidence</h2>
          <p class="section-subtitle">The full report includes all {{ total_queries }} answers from this run plus 32 more queries across Claude, ChatGPT, Perplexity and Gemini.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      {% if first_query %}
      <details open>
        <summary>
          {{ first_query }}
          <span class="pill">{{ first_rows[0].response.query_type }}</span>
          {% set v = first_rows | selectattr('deterministic.mentioned') | list | length %}
          {% if v > 0 %}
            <span class="pill good">{{ config.brand.name }} appears</span>
          {% else %}
            <span class="pill bad">{{ config.brand.name }} does not appear</span>
          {% endif %}
        </summary>
        {% for row in first_rows %}
          {% if not row.response.error %}
            <div class="response-text">{{ row.response.response_text[:600] }}{% if row.response.response_text|length > 600 %}…{% endif %}</div>
          {% endif %}
        {% endfor %}
      </details>
      {% endif %}
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <div class="section-header">
        <div>
          <h2>What unlocks in the full audit</h2>
          <p class="section-subtitle">The paid report turns the snapshot into an action plan: engine-by-engine visibility, hallucinations, citations, competitors and query-level evidence.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <h3 style="margin:0 0 10px;font-size:18px;letter-spacing:-.02em;">Engine heatmap — how 5 engines compare</h3>
      <div class="locked">
        <div class="blur">
          <table>
            <tr><td></td><td style="text-align:center;">Claude</td><td style="text-align:center;">ChatGPT</td><td style="text-align:center;">Perplexity</td><td style="text-align:center;">Gemini</td><td style="text-align:center;">Google</td></tr>
            <tr><td><strong>brand</strong></td><td style="text-align:center;background:#dcfce7;">57%</td><td style="text-align:center;background:#bbf7d0;">64%</td><td style="text-align:center;background:#86efac;">71%</td><td style="text-align:center;background:#4ade80;">78%</td><td style="text-align:center;background:#22c55e;color:white;">85%</td></tr>
            <tr><td><strong>category</strong></td><td style="text-align:center;background:#dcfce7;">57%</td><td style="text-align:center;background:#bbf7d0;">64%</td><td style="text-align:center;background:#86efac;">71%</td><td style="text-align:center;background:#4ade80;">78%</td><td style="text-align:center;background:#22c55e;color:white;">85%</td></tr>
            <tr><td><strong>problem</strong></td><td style="text-align:center;background:#dcfce7;">57%</td><td style="text-align:center;background:#bbf7d0;">64%</td><td style="text-align:center;background:#86efac;">71%</td><td style="text-align:center;background:#4ade80;">78%</td><td style="text-align:center;background:#22c55e;color:white;">85%</td></tr>
            <tr><td><strong>comparison</strong></td><td style="text-align:center;background:#dcfce7;">57%</td><td style="text-align:center;background:#bbf7d0;">64%</td><td style="text-align:center;background:#86efac;">71%</td><td style="text-align:center;background:#4ade80;">78%</td><td style="text-align:center;background:#22c55e;color:white;">85%</td></tr>
